   "priceMinor": 249000,
   "currency": "EUR",
   "availability": "sold_out",
   "description": "The Majestic – Night Sky Limited edition belongs to the elegant Biatec Majestic Collection and features a unique dial from natural stone (quartz) called blue Aventurine. Since this stone is fragile at the thickness of the dial, only the best factories in the world are capable to apply at this stone indexes by feets. To finish one complete dial means that the 6-9 dials were broken / wasted. Every dial is unique by its structure. The blue Aventurine combines the elements of Wind and Water in a gentle stone that resonates from the mind to the heart, working calmly, rationally, and steadily. It enhances the masculine energy in both males and females, and is a stone of self-discipline and inner strength, assisting one in making clear decisions and sticking by them. It promotes taking full responsibility for one’s life, relationships and experiences, while lending the support needed to empower change when the current reality isn’t working.",
